{'symbol': 'LEN', 'date': '2021-07-27 09:03:00', 'title': 'LMC ANNOUNCES LAND CLOSING FOR ARTEMAS APARTMENTS', 'text': 'BOSTON, JULY 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LMC , A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF LENNAR CORPORATION AND A LEADER IN APARTMENT DEVELOPMENT AND MANAGEMENT, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAND CLOSING FOR ITS LATEST MULTIFAMILY DEVELOPMENT, ARTEMAS, IN THE ACTIVE NORTH BOSTON SUBURB OF EVERETT. THE MID-RISE COMMUNITY WILL INCLUDE 396 APARTMENT HOMES AND 1,500 SQUARE FEET OF RETAIL SPACE.'}